{"overview":"Takemichi Hanagaki is a freelancer that’s reached the absolute pits of despair in his life. He finds out that the only girlfriend he ever had, in middle school, Hinata Tachibana, had been killed by the ruthless Tokyo Manji Gang. The day after hearing about her death, he’s standing on the station platform and ends up being pushed over onto the tracks by a herd of people. He closes his eyes thinking he’s about to die, but when he opens his eyes back up, he somehow had gone back in time 12 years. Now that he’s back living the best days of his life, Takemichi decides to get revenge on his life.","tagline":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":44,"y":2021,"poster":"/7BRtAyw86UXVuUZQOp1LmDPEu8p.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":55,"y":2021,"poster":"/yq7MAqDqfmPToIH4v2CCK380bK7.jpg"}],"episodes":55,"crew":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"新祐樹","role":"Takemichi Hanagaki (voice)","photo":"/pyOAlLSA9ZabbVy5HD8j9QuUdV8.jpg"},{"name":"和氣あず未","role":"Hinata Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/nxm4DLWv0BOcK2owvAz5yafSAXj.jpg"},{"name":"逢坂良太","role":"Naoto Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/d2TGy8Qkxe90tGDr9MCXFGkhbPl.jpg"},{"name":"林勇","role":"Manjiro 'Mikey' Sano (voice)","photo":"/tCABSsjU9fWZqTtOAGTGcUnEF2p.jpg"},{"name":"تاتسوهیسا سوزوکی","role":"Ken 'Doraken' Ryuguji (voice)","photo":"/foytL2OreKzQcTNftz2qMgClKKg.jpg"},{"name":"寺島拓篤","role":"Atsushi Sendo (voice)","photo":"/n5uCihb318AzQCT9gieMlI2ueYL.jpg"},{"name":"広瀬裕也","role":"Takuya Yamamoto (voice)","photo":"/jRe7ICqrCsaEWVD8jAmJdc7XwnQ.jpg"},{"name":"武内駿輔","role":"Makoto Suzuki (voice)","photo":"/p1bD76bPptJ41mKRtv0mIr8ZcvO.jpg"},{"name":"葉山翔太","role":"Kazushi Yamagishi (voice)","photo":"/q5THNf2FJdlzAFRcWtfwZGC4iqh.jpg"},{"name":"日野聡","role":"Masataka Koyomizu (voice)","photo":"/8ZJIiwIVF2zDyyFr7oXewj0eEuu.jpg"},{"name":"水中雅章","role":"Keisuke Baji (voice)","photo":"/cHb2pr4juxk8A3VTuDxgPWHM6WF.jpg"},{"name":"سابارو کیمورا","role":"Haruki Hayashida (voice)","photo":"/